599 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 280 0 R
/E (Dozens of students attended the meeting throughout the day to learn from a student-centered agenda, in which board members and guest speakers shared how the board operates, the value of a CPA license and many relevant resources for students interested in the profession. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
600 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 280 0 R
